{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-88","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-88-talk-403815871-line","text":"你漫步在圣多明戈城…这里的灯光璀璨夺目。正当你沉浸其中时，你的右肩被拍了一下——你诧异地回头，接着左臂就立刻被擒住。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-88-talk-403815872-line","text":"「你好。」一位圣多明戈机械警察向你鞠了个躬，「走一趟吧。证据：您之前的『作弊代码』已被记录在案。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-88-text-2153601583014650417-choice","text":"被迫战斗。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-88-text-11579181696940562139-effect","text":"你没得选择！","speaker":""}]}
